		2856 -> 2865;
	2857 [label="Oui !! Oh, you do understand !! Par exemple -",shape=box,color=blue];
		2857 -> 2866;
	2850 [label="Do you know how tiring it is to have to float all the time, jour après jour, heure après heure, when others may walk ?",shape=box,color=blue];
		2850 -> 2860;
	2851 [label="But yes, it is frustrating. I sometimes would sit there and stare at a book on the top row of a case and think how unjust it was that I could not reach it.",shape=box,color=blue];
		2851 -> 2852;
	2852 [label="That it contained knowledge that I cared about, no one else, so why was I denied it ? And along would come some helpful soul who would pluck it from its place for me out of pity...",shape=box,color=blue];
		2852 -> 2861;
	2853 [label="I told him I needed to stay busy, needed to keep my hands moving. I do not think he quite understood why I must stay so active.",shape=box,color=blue];
		2853 -> 2862;
	2858 [label="But I still feel them, those twisted things that threatened to consume me, threatened to crush all hope and joie from my soul.",shape=box,color=blue];
		2858 -> 2867;
	2859 [label="To have a body that betrays you, that slows your spirit down. Even now, it is so strange. The sérum has changed me, given me flight -",shape=box,color=blue];
		2859 -> 2868;
	2863 [label="I told him I needed to stay busy, needed to keep my hands moving. I do not think he quite understood why I must stay so active.",shape=box,color=blue];
