	2866 [label="Do you know how tiring it is to have to float all the time, jour après jour, heure après heure, when others may walk ?",shape=box,color=blue];
		2866 -> 2875;
	2860 [label="I am ravie to be so mobile, to be able to reach anything I wish, do not mistake me. But it is still so exhausting !",shape=box,color=blue];
		2860 -> 2862;
	2861 [label="And it is not their fault, for they are doing an act of kindness - I needed the help. And it is not their fault that I needed it. But oh, how frustrating it is to need that assistance.",shape=box,color=blue];
		2861 -> 2869;
		2861 -> 2870;
	2862 [label="It is just... so nice to be able to speak of all this. I cannot properly put it into words. It is so rare to be able to discuss this kind of unseen, silent plague I suffer.",shape=box,color=blue];
		2862 -> 2871;
	2867 [label="Always they hurt. Always. Even now, as I sit here, if I think of them, I feel the pain. But it is not always enough that I notice.",shape=box,color=blue];
