	2892 [label="I will not speak of faith except to say that... flawed as we must think our forms from this limited view, we must... be at peace with what we are, non ? It is all we have.",shape=box,color=blue];
		2892 -> 2901;
	2891 [label="I know our faiths are similar in shape, so I will say that... Sol saw fit to make me as I am, and I must have faith in his design, non ? Flawed as I may think it from my limited view. I would wonder if you could not consider the same of yours.",shape=box,color=blue];
		2891 -> 2901;
	2893 [label="I know our faiths are dissimilar in shape, so I will not speak where I am not knowledgable. But I will simply say that Sol saw fit to make me as I am, and I must have faith in his design, non ? Flawed as I may think it from my limited view. I would wonder if you could not consider the same of yours.",shape=box,color=blue];
		2893 -> 2901;
	2894 [label="I know your faith is personal to you, so I will not pry. But I will simply say that Sol saw fit to make me as I am, and I must have faith in his design, non ? Flawed as I may think it from my limited view. I would wonder if you could not consider the same of yours.",shape=box,color=blue];
